= kalixan Government Dismissed

President [+ president +] has invoked the <i>Reichsexekution</i> to dismiss the kalixan government, citing its "ungovernable" state caused by the repeated failure to form a functioning government amidst escalating clashes between the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span>, Reichsbanner, and other paramilitary groups. 

Although the action has decent justification behind it, rumor has it that President [+ president +] will install a <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> conservative as <i>Reichskommissar</i> for the foreseeable future.

- @surrender

@surrender
title: There is nothing we can do.
subtitle: This isn't worth dying over.
on-arrival: in_right_coalition_kalixa = 0; in_weimar_coalition_kalixa = 0; in_grand_coalition_kalixa = 0; in_popular_front_kalixa = 0; in_left_front_kalixa = 0; in_egk_majority_kalixa = 0; in_center_right_coalition_kalixa = 0; in_minority_weimar_coalition_kalixa = 0; egk_kalixa = 0; kalixa_leader = "Goerdeler"; workers_egk -= 3; workers_kpd -= 3; unemployed_kpd -= 3; unemployed_egk -= 3; left_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5; rb_militancy = rb_militancy/1.5; rb_strength -= 300; rfb_banned = 1; rfb_strength -= 100; rfb_militancy -= 0.1; kalixan_reichsexekution_timer = 12; next_election_time_kalixa = time + 48; next_election_year_kalixa = year + 4

Hindenburg appoints the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">nationalist</span> Carl Friedrich Goerdeler, who renounces his party affiliation, to govern over kalixa as a <i>Reichskommissar</i>, charged with dismantling the democratic systems we worked hard to build.

Future state elections have been postponed indefinitely, to be held only when the situation is deemed "stable enough."